    <p> Are you the type of person who has an ever-changing answer for what you do with your free time? If so, you'd get along handsomely with me - Hot Mess Hobby Shop founder, Izzy Lloyd. Everything within HMHS started as a pet interest of mine that turned into a fundamental passion. Another thing I love? Sharing my passions with others, and showing other people how to find joy the same ways I have. And thus came the Hot Mess Hobby Shop: a place where chaos meets creativity, and messy is a good thing. </p>
